mounts/
.env
.stfolder
# Everything Claude Code keeps here is local state -- worktrees, locks, caches. Nothing
# is tracked under .claude/skills/ any more (the adding-a-service skill went to Cradle
# with the engine); the exception is kept for the next project-local skill, because one
# that is not tracked is invisible to a fresh clone and to every other session.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
*.dump
*.sql
*.secret
